Yes. In the completed primary-line data, **Pilar Assembly Works accounted for 460 of 742 reported defects (62.0%)**, so it represented a clear majority. Rosario reported 163 (22.0%) and Córdoba 119 (16.0%).

The broader query including secondary lines was still pending, so this conclusion applies only to the primary-line results.

